# 🔬 Analyze a thread dump (same for GC logs, heap dumps, flight recordings, CFK bundles, Oracle XStream reports)
Output docs/videos/analyze.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape
Source tapes/prelude.tape

Type "playground analyze thread-dump --sample deadlock_jdk21 --output-dir /tmp/kdp-video-thread-dump | less -R"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type " "
Sleep 5s
Type " "
Sleep 4s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
